      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/followlastma/status/1932166481782943854",
      "text": "[9PM] #Ketu #TrafficUpdate \n\nFree flow of traffic in and out of the axis, indicating a significant improvement in traffic conditions.\nFast-moving traffic from Ojota towards Interchange.\nSmooth traffic conditions on the Interchange ascending overhead bridge, down to 7Up.\nGood traffic flow on the stretch from Interchange/Iyana School through Tipper Garage, Demurin Junction, and Ile-Ile.\nImproved traffic conditions on the return journey from Iyana School, inward to Ile-Ile, down to Ikosi Junction, with both service lanes and main carriageways experiencing better movement.\nManageable traffic at Ikosi Junction, connecting Fruits Market, Interchange, and Ojota proper, with both service lanes and main carriageways operating relatively smoothly.\nBetter movement from Fruits Market inward Toll Gate.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
